      "content": "the door thing is just a metaphor though. in reality, if you look at it objectively, there's no actual difference between staying and leaving. if nothing has inherent meaning, then both options have a value of zero. it's like a math problem where the result is always the same regardless of the variable you pick. why is there such a bias towards staying if the outcome is mathematically neutral?",
